- "We’ve been taking our two-year-old twins out to eat more, and I find that I always need to explicitly ask the server for crayons, and when I do I often get a pause and a “Hm, let me see if I can find them.”" [ar033-0082]

**But:** The restaurant parent already knows possible workarounds and wants to discuss the change itself: "(Not looking for advice, btw. I know we can just bring crayons or sticker books from home. Just wondering if anybody else is experiencing the slow sad death of restaurant crayons.)" [ar033-0084]

