### They ask whether to leave happy independent play alone and how long to keep quiet time.

2 of 80 posts.

Two parents of two-year-olds describe children who are already content without an adult playing with them. One leaves a newly awake child babbling in bed; the other offers books and quiet toys after naps stop. They ask whether to interrupt this time or eventually stop providing it.

